The model-pinned CLI route is blocked here: no `OPENAI_API_KEY`, no `openai` Python package, and no service-account token in Keychain to fetch one. Prior course-asset work in this repo used the built-in image workflow in this exact situation, then resized and palette-flattened locally, so I’m taking that path and will save only the final repo asset.
